  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 301.28 Pumping test production rate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 301.28 “Pumping test production rate” means the constant pumping rate that is maintained throughout a pumping test or source evaluation, as applicable, on a production well, which is used to establish the permitted production volume.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 301) #11060, eff 4-1-16",
